<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A call can look fine in a preview and still need a quick check before an important conversation. Use the chosen app's own preview and device settings, then test the camera, speaker, microphone and light from the position where you will actually sit. A test is useful evidence about that moment; it does not guarantee that a future call or network connection will behave the same way.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Start with a private preview</h2><p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Check the selected device and room conditions before inviting anyone or sharing a call.</p><div class="ed-choices">
